<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy — Threads Deleter</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/index.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Threads Deleter</h1>
      <p>Privacy Policy</p>
    </header>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString() %></p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text);">1. Data Collection & Cookies</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Threads Deleter ("we", "our", or "us") operates as a <strong>stateless client-side tool</strong>.
        <br><br>
        <strong>We do not use cookies.</strong> Your authentication data (Access Token) is stored locally in your browser's <code>SessionStorage</code> and is transmitted securely to our server only when you perform an action.
        We do not maintain a database of user data.
      </p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text);">2. Data Usage</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        We use your Threads data solely to:
        <ul style="list-style: disc; margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
          <li>Display your username (for confirmation).</li>
          <li>Fetch your posts and replies (to show previews).</li>
          <li>Delete the specific content you select.</li>
        </ul>
      </p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text);">3. Data Retention</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        We do not retain any of your data.
        <br>
        - <strong>Access Tokens:</strong> Discarded immediately upon logout or when your session expires.
        <br>
        - <strong>Activity Logs:</strong> Processed in-memory and discarded. We do not store deletion history.
      </p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text);">4. Third-Party Services</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        This app retrieves data from the Meta Threads API. By using this app, you also agree to Meta's Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none;">&larr; Back to Home</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
